{"type":"FlowTopic","triggers":[{"type":"Trigger","name":"c0953895932048b1ad327283e6b0cd58","triggerType":"request","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"id":"c0953895932048b1ad327283e6b0cd58"}],"goals":[{"name":"primary","trigger_id":"c0953895932048b1ad327283e6b0cd58","nodes":[{"type":"StartGoal","goal_id":"primary","greeting_msg":{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":""},"id":"7f44b557cecd482896f2d363b2e571b1","name":"Start","expert_mode":false},{"type":"TerminateGoal","goal_id":"primary","confirmation_msg":{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":""},"id":"d85b3399b52e4848bb2af05f668dd1c6","name":"End","expert_mode":false},{"type":"InputPrompt","variable_id":"163c2162b3b2468c92c75b9a5a299fa0","message":{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":"gs.getMessageLang("Enter the case no you want to summarize", vaContext.getRequesterLang())"},"nlu_entity_binding":{"type":"NLUEntityBinding","allow_text_input":false,"use_confirmation_prompt":true},"request_feedback":true,"skippable":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"false"},"skipreprompt":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"false"},"metadataScript":"","cardName":"","cardFields":[],"id":"4cf1258642004b20a7999fc268d63dc7","name":"case number","goal_id":"primary","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"expert_mode":false,"formatType":"Text","validationScript":"","description":""},{"type":"CRUDAction","mode":"read","read_mode":"variable","query":"number={{vaInputs.case_number}}","variable_id":"e57d03852543460db3d8d67d3b805106","id":"f5cec062bb6641938fee6630b212960f","name":"HR case lookup","goal_id":"primary","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"expert_mode":false,"condition":{"type":"Condition","mode":"glide_query","value":"number={{vaInputs.case_number}}"}},{"type":"ScriptOutputPrompt","output_type":"single_part","id":"4e5455043170413d8a7edcd34ad7b437","name":"Generate HR Case Summary","goal_id":"primary","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"expert_mode":false,"value":{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":"(function execute() {

 var caseId = vaInputs.hr_case_lookup;

 var gr = new GlideRecord('x_snc_unified_hr_0_hr_case');

 if (gr.get(caseId)) {

 var response = '';

 response += 'Here is the summary of your HR case:\n\n';

 response += 'Case Number: ' + gr.getDisplayValue('number') + '\n';
 response += 'Requested By: ' + gr.getDisplayValue('request_by') + '\n';
 response += 'Category: ' + gr.getDisplayValue('category') + '\n';
 response += 'Priority: ' + gr.getDisplayValue('priority') + '\n';
 response += 'Status: ' + gr.getDisplayValue('status') + '\n';
 response += 'Assignment Group: ' + gr.getDisplayValue('assignment_group') + '\n';
 response += 'Assigned To: ' + gr.getDisplayValue('assigned_to') + '\n\n';

 response += 'Issue:\n';
 response += gr.getDisplayValue('description') + '\n\n';

 if (gr.getValue('resolution_notes')) {
 response += 'Resolution / Actions:\n';
 response += gr.getDisplayValue('resolution_notes') + '\n\n';
 }

 if (gr.getValue('rejection_feedback')) {
 response += 'Rejection Feedback:\n';
 response += gr.getDisplayValue('rejection_feedback') + '\n';
 }

 return response;

 }

 return 'I could not find the requested HR case.';

})()"},"secure":false},{"type":"ChoiceInputPrompt","expression_mode":"simple","metadataScript":"","cardName":"","cardFields":[],"id":"6a58c118c64f4f50a37a4cad36694595","name":"HR Choice","goal_id":"primary","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"expert_mode":false,"variable_id":"15fc74d0197643e68794197ea45338d1","message":{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":"gs.getMessageLang("Select your service", vaContext.getRequesterLang())"},"request_feedback":false,"skippable":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"false"},"skipreprompt":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"false"},"nlu_entity_binding":{"type":"NLUEntityBinding","allow_text_input":false,"use_confirmation_prompt":true},"description":""},{"type":"Decision","name":"Decision","branches":[{"type":"Branch","label":"Always","expression":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"query","value":"hr_choice=Case summary"},"id":"597108a6703f4778821639a81a6463f2","name":"Always","expert_mode":false},{"type":"Branch","label":"Always","expression":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"query","value":"hr_choice=Assigned cases"},"id":"9bb591fc1bde426d8bf1b5765758cd24","name":"Always","expert_mode":false},{"type":"Branch","label":"Always","expression":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"query","value":"hr_choice=Case Attention Insights"},"id":"a8faddebeabd426ca4ad95a5d7b83a7e","name":"Always","expert_mode":false}],"id":"98cf433cdb7a47719bbb5aaeca3bb189","goal_id":"primary","expert_mode":false},{"type":"ScriptOutputPrompt","output_type":"single_part","id":"013e952763c94f61a4c096f31ef50dc3","name":"hr cases retrieve ","goal_id":"primary","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"expert_mode":false,"value":{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":"(function execute() {

 var gr = new GlideRecord('x_snc_unified_hr_0_hr_case');

 // Find cases assigned to the currently logged-in HR agent
 gr.addQuery('assigned_to', gs.getUserID());
 gr.orderByDesc('sys_created_on');
 gr.query();

 var response = '';
 var count = 0;

 while (gr.next()) {

 count++;

 response += count + '. ' +
 gr.getDisplayValue('number') +
 ' - ' +
 gr.getDisplayValue('category') +
 ' - ' +
 gr.getDisplayValue('priority') +
 ' - ' +
 gr.getDisplayValue('status') +
 '\n';
 }

 if (count == 0) {
 return 'You currently have no HR cases assigned to you.';
 }

 return 'You have ' + count + ' HR case(s) assigned to you.\n\n' +
 response;

})()"},"secure":false},{"type":"ScriptOutputPrompt","output_type":"single_part","id":"5b5e01b63cb64c389f02f385707d63b2","name":"Case Attention Insights","goal_id":"primary","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"expert_mode":false,"value":{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":"(function execute() {

 var gr = new GlideRecord('x_snc_unified_hr_0_hr_case');

 gr.addQuery('assigned_to', gs.getUserID());
 gr.query();

 var total = 0;
 var highPriority = 0;
 var openCases = 0;
 var inProgressCases = 0;
 var attentionCases = '';

 while (gr.next()) {

 total++;

 var priority = gr.getDisplayValue('priority');
 var status = gr.getDisplayValue('status');

 if (priority == 'High'&&status!='Resolved') {
 highPriority++;
 }

 if (status == 'Open') {
 openCases++;
 }

 if (status == 'In Progress') {
 inProgressCases++;
 }

 // Cases requiring attention
 if ((priority == 'High' && status != 'Resolved') || status == 'Open') {

 attentionCases +=
 gr.getDisplayValue('number') +
 ' - ' +
 gr.getDisplayValue('priority') +
 ' - ' +
 gr.getDisplayValue('status') +
 ' - ' +
 gr.getDisplayValue('category') +
 '\n';
 }
 }

 if (total == 0) {
 return 'You currently have no cases assigned to you.';
 }

 var response = '';

 response += 'YOUR CASE WORKLOAD\n\n';

 response += 'Total Assigned: ' + total + '\n';
 response += 'High Priority: ' + highPriority + '\n';
 response += 'Open: ' + openCases + '\n';
 response += 'In Progress: ' + inProgressCases + '\n';

 if (attentionCases != '') {

 response += '\nCASES REQUIRING ATTENTION\n\n';
 response += attentionCases;

 } else {

 response += '\nNo cases currently require special attention.';
 }

 return response;

})()"},"secure":false},{"type":"InputPrompt","variable_id":"257a9593ffb94fe3a1f1969725d5cca1","message":{"type":"String","mode":"string","value":"gs.getMessageLang("Has your query been resolved, or do you need any further assistance?", vaContext.getRequesterLang())"},"nlu_entity_binding":{"type":"NLUEntityBinding","allow_text_input":false,"use_confirmation_prompt":true},"request_feedback":false,"skippable":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"false"},"skipreprompt":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"false"},"metadataScript":"","cardName":"","cardFields":[],"id":"af8f978cff9a4c8485521e4b24d651dc","name":"Final confirm","goal_id":"primary","applicability":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"script","value":"true"},"expert_mode":false,"description":""},{"type":"Decision","name":"Decision","branches":[{"type":"Branch","label":"true","expression":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"query","value":"final_confirm=true"},"id":"9218fd1c01e24f96942ec64ee993add0","name":"true","expert_mode":false},{"type":"Branch","label":"false","expression":{"type":"Applicability","mode":"query","value":"final_confirm=false"},"id":"a0c5e7e869fa40848339015a6e715473","name":"false","expert_mode":false}],"id":"830d38fda7fa49eba5851d7c52cd7f73","goal_id":"primary","expert_mode":false}],"edges":[{"type":"Edge","source_node_id":"830d38fda7fa49eba5851d7c52cd7f73","target_node_id":"6a58c118c64f4f50a37a4cad36694595","branch_id":"9218fd1c01e24f96942ec64ee993add0","id":"8a63f7efc8484f08a6ef1c5102421cc5","name":"9218fd1c01e24f96942ec64ee993add0"},{"type":"Edge","source_node_id":"830d38fda7fa49eba5851d7c52cd7f73","target_node_id":"d85b3399b52e4848bb2af05f668dd1c6","branch_id":"a0c5e7e869fa40848339015a6e715473","id":"cfe7089a8f1d4ee78b5e6d8403daa275","name":"a0c5e7e869fa40848339015a6e715473"},{"type":"Edge","source_node_id":"f5cec062bb6641938fee6630b212960f","target_node_id":"4e5455043170413d8a7edcd34ad7b437","id":"af1ed5c90fe444f1b7399aa7d01b28f8"},{"type":"Edge","source_node_id":"4cf12